{"5396090":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"One More Brick","steam_appid":5396090,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Just one more brick.<\/h2>A paddle, a ball, and a page full of bricks. You know what to do.<br><br>Break a few, pocket the coins, buy an upgrade. Then another. Before long, balls are splitting, lasers are cutting across the page, and that tidy little board is a mess of flying rewards. That's One More Brick: a brick breaker that keeps giving you another reason to play.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5396090\/extras\/13030b33143918ab43a1770132514af9.poster.avif?t=1793645597\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5396090\/extras\/13030b33143918ab43a1770132514af9.webm?t=1793645597\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5396090\/extras\/13030b33143918ab43a1770132514af9.mp4?t=1793645597\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What should we unlock next?<\/h2>More ball power? A wider paddle? Sticky dynamite sounds fun. Spend the bricks and coins you've collected on a sprawling skill tree, and watch new toys change the way you play. Try different balls, level their mastery, and put together a perk combination you like.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5396090\/extras\/6eb2f8a77a2ddabfa316590044492830.poster.avif?t=1793645597\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5396090\/extras\/6eb2f8a77a2ddabfa316590044492830.webm?t=1793645597\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5396090\/extras\/6eb2f8a77a2ddabfa316590044492830.mp4?t=1793645597\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Let the Infinite Breaker do its thing.<\/h2>Sometimes you've got upgrades to browse. Unlock the Infinite Breaker and let it bash away while you decide. Add more bricks, speed it up, and give it tougher materials to chew through.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5396090\/extras\/a795244c25826906654c241ede9fa0ae.poster.avif?t=1793645597\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5396090\/extras\/a795244c25826906654c241ede9fa0ae.webm?t=1793645597\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5396090\/extras\/a795244c25826906654c241ede9fa0ae.mp4?t=1793645597\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >There's always another page.<\/h2>Drop into the Workshop to craft charms, temper your balls, or pick a new trail ink. Collect stickers along the way. And when it's time to start a new sketchbook, turn your progress into Ink Drops for permanent Pen Tree upgrades.<br><br>New paper, new upgrades, bigger bounces. Somewhere ahead, the Final Brick is waiting.<br><br>All of it comes wrapped in scribbled lines, colorful crayon bricks, and textured sketchbook pages. Settle in. You've got a few bricks to break.","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Just one more brick.<\/h2>A paddle, a ball, and a page full of bricks. You know what to do.<br><br>Break a few, pocket the coins, buy an upgrade. Then another. Before long, balls are splitting, lasers are cutting across the page, and that tidy little board is a mess of flying rewards. That's One More Brick: a brick breaker that keeps giving you another reason to play.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5396090\/extras\/13030b33143918ab43a1770132514af9.poster.avif?t=1793645597\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5396090\/extras\/13030b33143918ab43a1770132514af9.webm?t=1793645597\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5396090\/extras\/13030b33143918ab43a1770132514af9.mp4?t=1793645597\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What should we unlock next?<\/h2>More ball power? A wider paddle? Sticky dynamite sounds fun. Spend the bricks and coins you've collected on a sprawling skill tree, and watch new toys change the way you play. Try different balls, level their mastery, and put together a perk combination you like.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5396090\/extras\/6eb2f8a77a2ddabfa316590044492830.poster.avif?t=1793645597\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5396090\/extras\/6eb2f8a77a2ddabfa316590044492830.webm?t=1793645597\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5396090\/extras\/6eb2f8a77a2ddabfa316590044492830.mp4?t=1793645597\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Let the Infinite Breaker do its thing.<\/h2>Sometimes you've got upgrades to browse. Unlock the Infinite Breaker and let it bash away while you decide. Add more bricks, speed it up, and give it tougher materials to chew through.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5396090\/extras\/a795244c25826906654c241ede9fa0ae.poster.avif?t=1793645597\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5396090\/extras\/a795244c25826906654c241ede9fa0ae.webm?t=1793645597\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5396090\/extras\/a795244c25826906654c241ede9fa0ae.mp4?t=1793645597\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >There's always another page.<\/h2>Drop into the Workshop to craft charms, temper your balls, or pick a new trail ink. Collect stickers along the way. And when it's time to start a new sketchbook, turn your progress into Ink Drops for permanent Pen Tree upgrades.<br><br>New paper, new upgrades, bigger bounces. Somewhere ahead, the Final Brick is waiting.<br><br>All of it comes wrapped in scribbled lines, colorful crayon bricks, and textured sketchbook pages. Settle in. You've got a few bricks to break.","short_description":"A cozy incremental brick breaker on a scribbled sketchbook page. Smash bricks, collect the rewards, and buy upgrades until balls split, lasers fly, and the page gets wonderfully messy. Grow your skill tree, put the Infinite Breaker to work, and turn over a new page.","supported_languages":"English<strong>*<\/strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Arabic, Bulgarian, Czech, Danish, Dutch, Finnish, Greek, Hungarian, Indonesian, Japanese, Korean, Malay, Norwegian, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Romanian, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Swedish, Thai, Traditional Chinese, Turkish, Ukrainian, Vietnamese<br><strong>*<\/strong>languages with full audio support","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5396090\/d98a29cd2ef8fb454b7b25a2f861130ec6c1a1ba\/header.jpg?t=1793645597","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5396090\/ae4e75c41a32a43ed1e5a01fbbffbe526a6fe662\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793645597","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5396090\/ae4e75c41a32a43ed1e5a01fbbffbe526a6fe662\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793645597","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 21H1 (64-bit) or Windows 11 (64-bit)<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core 2 Duo E8400 or AMD Phenom II X2 550<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 2 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Intel HD Graphics 4000 or equivalent<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 1 GB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> DirectX compatible sound card<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 21H1 (64-bit) or Windows 11 (64-bit)<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i3-6100 or AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 650 or AMD Radeon HD 7750<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 1 GB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> DirectX compatible sound card<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> macOS 12 Monterey or newer<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core i5<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 2 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Metal-capable integrated graphics or equivalent<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 1 GB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> Standard built-in audio<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> Requires a 64-bit processor; Apple Silicon and Intel supported<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> macOS 12 Monterey or newer<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core i5 (2018 or later)<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Apple M1 GPU or AMD Radeon Pro 560<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 1 GB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> Standard built-in audio<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> Requires a 64-bit processor; Apple Silicon and Intel supported<\/li><\/ul>"},"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Ubuntu 22.04 LTS or SteamOS 3.0<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core 2 Duo E8400 or AMD Athlon 64 X2<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 2 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Intel HD Graphics 4000 or equivalent with OpenGL 3.2+ or Vulkan support<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 1 GB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> ALSA compatible sound card<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system; up-to-date graphics drivers<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Ubuntu 24.04 LTS or SteamOS 3.0<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i3-6100 or AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Intel HD Graphics 4000 or equivalent (OpenGL 3.2+)<br><\/li><li><strong>Stora